    "project_purpose": "Manta CeDeFi is a Manta-based yield and basis-trading product that combines centralized and decentralized finance to generate returns. Its on-chain surface is broader than a single vault and includes multiple deposit, vault, withdrawal, token or staking, routing or management, messaging, and upgrade components, including TransparentUpgradeableProxy deployments whose current implementations should be tracked separately from the proxy shells.",
